WEBVTT

00:00:03.760 --> 00:00:06.980
<i>Present day 
high school student Saburo</i>

00:00:07.340 --> 00:00:11.040
<i>finds himself taken back in time 
to the Warring States period.</i>

00:00:12.280 --> 00:00:15.600
I ask you to use your manly face

00:00:16.010 --> 00:00:17.780
to be my decoy!

00:00:17.780 --> 00:00:20.440
Tsuneoki, I haven't seen our lord.

00:00:20.440 --> 00:00:22.960
Is he on another so-called "date"?

00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:25.330
What is that man doing?

00:00:25.330 --> 00:00:26.460
You're hired!

00:00:26.460 --> 00:00:30.090
Such a pest, that old man.

00:00:31.880 --> 00:00:34.400
Rule the land.

00:00:34.980 --> 00:00:36.300
Rule.

00:00:36.900 --> 00:00:41.520
<i>And he came to live 
as Nobunaga Oda.</i>

00:00:50.320 --> 00:00:52.030
<b>Episode 3</b>

00:00:50.320 --> 00:00:52.030
<b>Viper of Mino</b>

00:00:55.190 --> 00:00:59.320
<b>Seishuji</b>

00:00:59.320 --> 00:01:04.470
<b>Grave of Masamune Hirate</b>

00:01:23.660 --> 00:01:25.340
Hirate.

00:01:25.670 --> 00:01:28.310
I wanted to come sooner.

00:01:28.310 --> 00:01:32.120
Is this really what 
you want, my lord?

00:01:32.690 --> 00:01:36.740
You have stated that you were 
the reason for Hirate's suicide.

00:01:37.270 --> 00:01:39.620
Your reputation is 
going to plummet.

00:01:40.230 --> 00:01:43.740
There's nothing more 
honorless to a samurai

00:01:44.200 --> 00:01:47.740
than to be killed 
by a total stranger.

00:01:50.800 --> 00:01:52.000
Right?

00:01:53.690 --> 00:01:55.160
Yes.

00:01:58.710 --> 00:02:01.100
<i>Rule the land.</i>

00:02:04.110 --> 00:02:06.870
I will, Hirate.

00:02:10.520 --> 00:02:11.900
Kichou,

00:02:12.890 --> 00:02:14.400
what are you up to?

00:02:15.440 --> 00:02:18.580
I am writing a letter 
to my father and mother.

00:02:21.310 --> 00:02:22.930
Where's your family from?

00:02:24.300 --> 00:02:27.290
Mino, of course!

00:02:28.880 --> 00:02:31.180
Huh? Mino?

00:02:31.180 --> 00:02:32.750
Oh, is that an old name?

00:02:34.460 --> 00:02:36.300
Old?

00:02:43.860 --> 00:02:47.560
Ahh, it's around modern-day Gifu!

00:02:47.560 --> 00:02:50.430
Owari's in Aichi, so...

00:02:52.980 --> 00:02:54.860
So we're neighbors!

00:02:56.120 --> 00:03:00.520
<i>In those times, neighbors fought 
against each other for land.</i>

00:03:00.520 --> 00:03:04.200
<i>Thanks to Nobunaga and 
Kichou's strategic marriage,</i>

00:03:04.480 --> 00:03:07.440
<i>Owari and Mino had a peaceful 
relationship, but...</i>

00:03:11.130 --> 00:03:12.500
I do not like it.

00:03:13.010 --> 00:03:15.600
What does Kichou's letter say?

00:03:15.600 --> 00:03:20.430
As always, she is 
gushing over her lord.

00:03:20.430 --> 00:03:24.280
He is seducing my daughter. 
Nobunaga, that bastard.

00:03:24.280 --> 00:03:26.760
But is that not strange?

00:03:26.760 --> 00:03:29.350
He is generally regarded a fool.

00:03:29.350 --> 00:03:31.690
I will meet Nobunaga.

00:03:32.210 --> 00:03:35.100
I have already 
requested a meeting.

00:03:35.100 --> 00:03:40.490
Nobuhide Oda has died, 
followed by his servant Masahide Hirate.

00:03:40.490 --> 00:03:46.160
What will become of Oda's future,
and of Owari's future?

00:03:46.540 --> 00:03:48.160
Nobunaga Oda.

00:03:48.640 --> 00:03:52.750
I will see you with my own eyes,
 and if you are worthless,

00:03:53.270 --> 00:03:55.750
I will crush you 
with these hands.

00:03:56.440 --> 00:04:00.710
<i>This man is Kichou's father: 
the feared Viper of Mino,</i>

00:04:01.180 --> 00:04:03.340
<i>Dousan Saito.</i>

00:04:03.340 --> 00:04:04.650
What?

00:04:04.650 --> 00:04:06.680
Your dad's nickname is "snake"?

00:04:07.140 --> 00:04:09.860
No, not "snake"! Viper.

00:04:09.860 --> 00:04:12.850
That is how much he is feared.

00:04:14.110 --> 00:04:16.440
Ugh... what'll I do...

00:04:16.440 --> 00:04:18.740
I just accepted his 
invitation for a meeting.

00:04:18.740 --> 00:04:21.610
What? Did you really do that?!

00:04:21.610 --> 00:04:23.860
My lord, I beg of you to listen:

00:04:23.860 --> 00:04:26.380
please do not meet 
with my father.

00:04:26.380 --> 00:04:27.990
It will be dangerous!

00:04:29.470 --> 00:04:31.410
It'll be fine.

00:04:31.410 --> 00:04:32.350
Probably.

00:04:32.350 --> 00:04:38.120
Anyway... since I'm meeting with your dad, 
is there anything you want to tell him?

00:04:38.120 --> 00:04:39.040
I'll pass it on.

00:04:40.900 --> 00:04:43.660
Anything I want to tell him?

00:04:47.070 --> 00:04:48.800
Not really.

00:04:56.220 --> 00:04:58.360
<i>It was the day of the meeting.</i>

00:04:58.360 --> 00:05:01.820
<i>Oda soldiers marched forward, 
heavy and threatening.</i>

00:05:02.500 --> 00:05:04.610
Hey, what is that?

00:05:06.410 --> 00:05:08.550
Hey, what is it?

00:05:09.230 --> 00:05:11.040
What've you got there?

00:05:13.830 --> 00:05:14.540
Hey!

00:05:15.910 --> 00:05:19.000
It is the kimono the lord 
will wear at the meeting!

00:05:19.700 --> 00:05:21.180
The lord?

00:05:22.520 --> 00:05:24.040
I'm gonna hold it!

00:05:24.040 --> 00:05:24.630
What?

00:05:24.630 --> 00:05:27.340
Don't be shy! It must be heavy.

00:05:27.340 --> 00:05:28.340
I'll hold it.

00:05:28.340 --> 00:05:29.450
Stop it!

00:05:29.450 --> 00:05:31.370
I said I'll hold it for you!

00:05:31.370 --> 00:05:32.580
I said it was fine.

00:05:32.580 --> 00:05:35.780
Those two are fighting again.

00:05:35.780 --> 00:05:37.420
Why not do rock-paper-scissors?

00:05:37.420 --> 00:05:39.250
Let go of it!

00:05:37.770 --> 00:05:38.540
Huh?

00:05:39.250 --> 00:05:40.310
I will hold it!

00:05:40.310 --> 00:05:41.600
I'm going to!

00:05:49.950 --> 00:05:51.870
Oh, man...

00:05:54.310 --> 00:05:56.010
What are we going to do?

00:05:56.010 --> 00:05:59.750
That is the only formal wear 
we have brought for the lord!

00:06:00.660 --> 00:06:02.880
I will pay immediately 
with my life!

00:06:02.880 --> 00:06:04.030
You don't have to.

00:06:08.880 --> 00:06:12.580
I'll go back to the castle 
to get new clothes!

00:06:14.130 --> 00:06:15.470
My lord!

00:06:17.060 --> 00:06:18.130
My lord...

00:06:24.510 --> 00:06:27.720
That man is making 
his father-in-law wait.

00:06:27.720 --> 00:06:29.860
What is the purpose of this?

00:06:30.130 --> 00:06:32.120
We are terribly sorry!

00:06:33.070 --> 00:06:38.320
If the circumstances call for it,
 I will cut him down immediately.

00:06:39.100 --> 00:06:41.430
That fool.

00:06:47.000 --> 00:06:49.880
Hi! Sorry to keep you waiting!

00:06:50.160 --> 00:06:53.720
What is the meaning of 
that outrageous attire?

00:06:54.920 --> 00:06:58.620
This uniform's sure unpopular.

00:06:58.620 --> 00:07:01.970
But this is what students 
normally wear on formal occasions,

00:07:01.970 --> 00:07:03.480
hundreds of years from now.

00:07:03.480 --> 00:07:06.060
What nonsense is this —

00:07:06.060 --> 00:07:07.500
Stand down, Yoshitatsu.

00:07:07.500 --> 00:07:08.400
But, Father...

00:07:08.980 --> 00:07:10.640
Stand down!

00:07:12.410 --> 00:07:15.560
I wish to be alone with Nobunaga.

00:07:24.880 --> 00:07:27.950
My lord is going to get killed!

00:07:29.840 --> 00:07:31.510
Are you surprised?

00:07:32.900 --> 00:07:37.220
Well, I really didn't expect it.

00:07:37.720 --> 00:07:41.620
So Kichou's father was a policeman?

00:07:41.620 --> 00:07:44.420
It must be surprising.

00:07:44.420 --> 00:07:48.620
But this is who I really am.

00:07:49.880 --> 00:07:55.200
This uniform is 
proof of who I am.

00:07:56.360 --> 00:08:00.810
I will never forget that autumn, 
thirty years ago.

00:08:05.650 --> 00:08:11.240
I was suddenly transported to 
this Warring States period.

00:08:11.240 --> 00:08:15.570
Oil!

00:08:12.640 --> 00:08:15.820
I have worked hard to survive.

00:08:15.570 --> 00:08:16.850
Oil, please.

00:08:16.850 --> 00:08:17.740
Sure!

00:08:17.610 --> 00:08:24.160
I must survive until I can return
to my own time.

00:08:25.500 --> 00:08:30.330
These clothes have 
reminded me of that fact.

00:08:34.190 --> 00:08:39.260
You must understand how I feel.

00:08:43.540 --> 00:08:44.620
Sure.

00:08:45.740 --> 00:08:52.800
But I never expected to have a chance 
to wear these clothes in this time.

00:08:53.730 --> 00:08:57.220
You don't really look 
good in them, though.

00:09:04.370 --> 00:09:05.060
Huh?

00:09:06.960 --> 00:09:08.520
Did I offend you?

00:09:09.870 --> 00:09:14.020
I have grown quite old.

00:09:15.070 --> 00:09:17.640
It has been a long thirty years.

00:09:18.320 --> 00:09:23.420
I have completely adapted 
to the Warring States world.

00:09:24.240 --> 00:09:27.050
I leave this uniform

00:09:28.240 --> 00:09:30.040
with you.

00:09:31.120 --> 00:09:32.510
Huh?

00:09:32.510 --> 00:09:37.490
No, thanks. I don't want to 
become a policeman.

00:09:37.490 --> 00:09:39.720
I want to become the ruler of Japan.

00:09:40.990 --> 00:09:43.130
I am not giving it to you.

00:09:43.130 --> 00:09:45.830
I want you to deliver it 
to someone.

00:09:48.240 --> 00:09:49.730
Kichou?

00:09:50.200 --> 00:09:51.380
No.

00:09:54.280 --> 00:09:58.140
I want you to return it to 
my other daughter.

00:09:58.680 --> 00:10:03.990
I have a single daughter 
from my own time.

00:10:04.810 --> 00:10:09.700
I will most probably die 
in this time period.

00:10:09.700 --> 00:10:11.430
That is my suspicion.

00:10:12.250 --> 00:10:15.880
I am at peace with that, now.

00:10:16.510 --> 00:10:20.680
But you are still young.

00:10:21.390 --> 00:10:26.770
You may one day return 
to your own time.

00:10:27.550 --> 00:10:30.480
If that day comes,

00:10:30.480 --> 00:10:35.500
I want you to give this to 
my daughter, as a keepsake.

00:10:37.350 --> 00:10:41.120
What is going on?

00:10:43.230 --> 00:10:45.360
Saburo, huh?

00:10:47.050 --> 00:10:48.040
I'm sorry,

00:10:48.970 --> 00:10:51.820
I don't know if I can return 
this to your daughter.

00:10:53.110 --> 00:10:58.590
I'm still aiming to rule Japan 
as Nobunaga Oda.

00:11:06.880 --> 00:11:08.740
You must not die.

00:11:11.760 --> 00:11:13.190
Is this true?

00:11:14.440 --> 00:11:17.810
He really gave this to you?

00:11:18.360 --> 00:11:19.390
Yup!

00:11:26.520 --> 00:11:30.440
My father cared for this 
with his life.

00:11:31.240 --> 00:11:33.090
And he is now giving it to you.

00:11:35.110 --> 00:11:38.660
He must have been very 
impressed with you.

00:11:39.960 --> 00:11:42.510
He wasn't as scary as 
you said, your dad.

00:11:51.180 --> 00:11:54.920
I am glad you are home safe.

00:12:02.350 --> 00:12:06.660
<i>Having been highly pleased with 
Nobunaga at the meeting at Shoutokuji,</i>

00:12:03.110 --> 00:12:06.660
Shoutokuji

00:12:06.990 --> 00:12:11.970
<i>Dousan became a strong supporter 
to him, and was quick to cooperate.</i>

00:12:12.590 --> 00:12:17.750
<i>Saburo became the 
highest power in Owari,</i>

00:12:18.290 --> 00:12:21.020
<i>and moved his residence 
to Kiyosu Castle.</i>

00:12:29.940 --> 00:12:33.940
You are so preoccupied 
by that lately, my lord.

00:12:34.610 --> 00:12:36.770
Nobunaga was known for his guns.

00:12:37.080 --> 00:12:39.520
Is that so?

00:12:40.120 --> 00:12:44.200
I'm not sure, but my 
textbook says something

00:12:44.530 --> 00:12:47.920
about him and his guns 
at Nagashima.

00:12:48.570 --> 00:12:49.990
Textbook?

00:12:50.230 --> 00:12:53.410
Yeah, in some battle 
with the Takedas.

00:12:53.940 --> 00:12:55.750
I do not understand!

00:12:56.140 --> 00:12:59.560
Yeah, it's still in the future.

00:13:03.620 --> 00:13:06.900
I do not like those "guns."

00:13:06.900 --> 00:13:08.890
They are loud and cast smoke!

00:13:08.890 --> 00:13:13.200
But your dad gave me all these.

00:13:14.550 --> 00:13:15.570
What's your problem?

00:13:15.570 --> 00:13:21.610
My father has brought you so many 
things since that meeting.

00:13:23.720 --> 00:13:27.740
I wonder how my father is doing.

00:13:26.380 --> 00:13:27.740
Hey! Stop that!

00:13:28.160 --> 00:13:30.970
I heard a peculiar rumor.

00:13:30.970 --> 00:13:36.820
My father and my older brother 
Yoshitatsu may soon be at war.

00:13:40.600 --> 00:13:41.910
Yeah.

00:13:43.530 --> 00:13:46.320
I heard that rumor, too.

00:13:49.430 --> 00:13:54.150
I hope they will come 
to an understanding.

00:13:57.010 --> 00:13:59.650
<i>But Kichou's hopes were not to be.</i>

00:14:00.130 --> 00:14:03.940
The armies have taken up positions on 
opposite sides of the Nagara River in Mino.

00:14:04.410 --> 00:14:05.660
How many soldiers?

00:14:05.660 --> 00:14:08.660
Yoshitatsu's army consists 
of roughly 17,000 men.

00:14:08.660 --> 00:14:12.020
Dousan's contains fewer than 3,000.

00:14:13.540 --> 00:14:17.650
Not even Dousan would stand a chance 
with such a difference in armies.

00:14:17.650 --> 00:14:19.410
Has he no chance to win?

00:14:22.200 --> 00:14:28.510
What you mean is that many of his men 
abandoned him, and sided with my brother.

00:14:30.150 --> 00:14:32.170
My poor father.

00:14:35.800 --> 00:14:36.960
Kichou,

00:14:41.470 --> 00:14:42.970
I'll help your dad.

00:14:48.730 --> 00:14:49.620
My lord.

00:14:52.140 --> 00:14:52.910
Follow him!

00:14:55.010 --> 00:14:57.220
We are moving out. Follow him!

00:15:04.800 --> 00:15:06.550
For thirty years,

00:15:06.860 --> 00:15:12.400
I have struggled to survive in the 
Warring States world, and this is what I get.

00:15:12.760 --> 00:15:15.210
Down with Dousan!

00:15:13.450 --> 00:15:19.090
My son betrayed me, and many 
of my servants have sided with him.

00:15:15.210 --> 00:15:17.390
Yeah!

00:15:19.090 --> 00:15:23.520
This place I have made for myself 
is no longer mine.

00:15:24.470 --> 00:15:28.090
The Warring States world 
is a lonely one.

00:15:29.450 --> 00:15:31.990
My lord, Nobunaga-sama 
will surely bring help.

00:15:32.220 --> 00:15:37.060
I told you, 
I never asked for his help.

00:15:38.080 --> 00:15:41.520
I do not intend to 
bring him into my war.

00:15:42.770 --> 00:15:47.070
I need Nobunaga to live.

00:15:52.150 --> 00:15:53.870
Get on, quickly!

00:15:54.210 --> 00:15:55.810
Quickly!

00:15:57.170 --> 00:15:58.850
But, my lord,

00:15:58.850 --> 00:16:02.730
I still do not think we have a chance, 
arriving in such small numbers.

00:16:02.730 --> 00:16:05.860
Will it not only endanger you?

00:16:05.860 --> 00:16:07.870
You're not even wearing armor!

00:16:07.870 --> 00:16:11.920
I need to live to 
get back to my own time.

00:16:14.050 --> 00:16:16.740
What did you say?

00:16:16.740 --> 00:16:23.250
Sir! Nobunaga Oda's forces are 
crossing the river to come here.

00:16:23.250 --> 00:16:24.120
That fool!

00:16:25.290 --> 00:16:29.630
He knows there is almost no chance 
of winning this war.

00:16:30.550 --> 00:16:34.980
And yet, he takes such risks.

00:16:34.980 --> 00:16:37.490
I did not even ask for his help.

00:16:38.250 --> 00:16:40.890
He is truly an idiot!

00:16:43.130 --> 00:16:44.880
You fool!

00:16:49.690 --> 00:16:52.570
Please, wait!

00:16:52.570 --> 00:16:55.560
It is dangerous to go in first!

00:16:59.660 --> 00:17:03.290
Nobunaga Oda-sama, 
I beg of you, stop!

00:17:04.980 --> 00:17:06.100
Who are you?

00:17:08.670 --> 00:17:13.760
My lord, Dousan Saito,

00:17:15.960 --> 00:17:17.850
was shot dead moments ago.

00:17:19.280 --> 00:17:23.350
He asked me to deliver this to you.

00:17:27.990 --> 00:17:31.400
He implores you to 
return to Owari,

00:17:31.700 --> 00:17:33.980
so that you do not die.

00:17:35.260 --> 00:17:37.650
Those were his final words.

00:17:41.860 --> 00:17:44.690
Please, hear his words.

00:17:46.860 --> 00:17:48.190
Fine.

00:17:48.730 --> 00:17:50.170
I'll go back.

00:17:58.890 --> 00:18:00.220
Over there!

00:18:03.520 --> 00:18:06.500
I received it!

00:18:07.140 --> 00:18:10.580
Everyone, retreat!

00:18:22.770 --> 00:18:24.250
Get on, quickly!

00:18:25.360 --> 00:18:26.540
Hurry!

00:18:27.130 --> 00:18:28.670
Chase that small army!

00:18:29.130 --> 00:18:31.130
Nobunaga's head is 
worth much glory!

00:18:31.490 --> 00:18:33.670
Which one is Nobunaga?

00:18:40.480 --> 00:18:42.780
My lord, to the boat, quickly!

00:18:48.820 --> 00:18:50.640
Get down!

00:18:51.100 --> 00:18:52.600
Fire!

00:18:57.640 --> 00:19:01.850
I couldn't do anything.

00:19:14.950 --> 00:19:17.340
Our lord has returned!

00:19:26.330 --> 00:19:28.730
I am glad you are safe.

00:19:42.440 --> 00:19:44.740
Sorry, Kichou.

00:19:46.420 --> 00:19:50.200
I couldn't help your dad.

00:19:55.570 --> 00:19:58.340
My father lived through 
times of turmoil.

00:19:58.340 --> 00:20:00.840
He was surely prepared for death.

00:20:02.100 --> 00:20:05.820
You came to his aid on horseback.

00:20:07.020 --> 00:20:09.130
Your kindness

00:20:10.450 --> 00:20:13.200
is enough for me.

00:21:01.110 --> 00:21:06.610
<b>Shin'ichi Nagai</b>

00:21:01.850 --> 00:21:04.190
I'll try not to die,

00:21:05.460 --> 00:21:06.610
Nagai, old man.
